<title>USA: Channell Commercial Corp Q1 net eases.</title>
<headline>Channell Commercial Corp Q1 net eases.</headline>
<dateline>TEMECULA, Calif. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>						  3 Months Ended</p>
<p>							 March 31</p>
<p>						  1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenue				     12.804	10.279</p>
<p> Gross Profit				 5.143	 4.541</p>
<p> Operating Profit			   2.093	 2.189</p>
<p> Net Income				   1.387	 2.002</p>
<p> Pro Forma Net Income*		    1.387	 1.279</p>
<p> Pro Forma Net Income Per Share*	  .15	   .17</p>
<p> Weighted Average Shares Outstanding  9.237	 7.695</p>
<p> Period End Net Income Per Share**	.15	   .14</p>
<p> Period End Outstanding Shares**	9.237	 8.837</p>
<p> EBIT					   2.093	 2.189</p>
<p> EBITDA					 2.583	 2.591</p>
<p>*Pro forma for the Company's conversion from an S Corporation to a C Corporation upon the Company's Initial Public Offering, for 1996 presentation. 1997 amounts are actual.</p>
<p>** Consists of 6,137,000 outstanding shares of common stock prior to the offering, 2,700,000 shares of common stock issued by the Company in the Initial Public Offering and 400,000 shares of common stock issued by the exercise of the underwriter's overallotment option, for 1996 presentation.</p>
